      "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "1. OpenCV Geometric Dewarp",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-step1-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 280,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "• Input: Angled smartphone photo\n• Edge detect (Canny + Bilateral)\n• Find 4-corner document contour\n• 4-point perspective homography\n• Warp to flat rectangular A4 plane\n• Contrast normalization\n\nResult:\n✓ Leveled text baselines\n✓ Frontal rectangular document\n✓ Zero tilt, zero perspective skew",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
