      "width": 280,
      "height": 280,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "• Acts as professional Word typist\n• Output: Clean GFM Markdown\n• Mottos: Centered # Title\n• Sections: ## Điều 1, ### 1.1\n• Tables: Standard | STT | Tên |\n• Signatures: 2-column table\n• Flowing body paragraphs\n\nAudit Pass (Optional):\n✓ Audits extracted text against ink\n✓ Fixes missing numbers/diacritics",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
