      "width": 300,
      "height": 280,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "• Canvas: Pristine #FFFFFF A4\n• Margins: Uniform 20mm\n• Typography: Roboto Unicode\n  - Title: 16pt bold centered\n  - Sections: 12pt bold\n  - Body: 10.5pt justified (align=J)\n• Word Tables: #F2F4F8 header fill,\n  thin gray borders, dynamic widths\n• Signatures: 2-column borderless\n• Footer: Trang X / Y centered",
      "fontSize": 14,
